% composition-bridge: Listen to breath as part of the tone and to silence as part of the phrase, not as an empty mistake.
% composition-context: Riley Lee's shakuhachi performance can introduce a Japanese end-blown bamboo flute and the discipline of sustained listening. This new vocal study is not honkyoku and does not imitate a sacred piece.
% composition-distance: Original melody and words; no pitch sequence or ornament is taken from the reference.
